<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1141</h1><p class="ref-lede">1141 in world history: 8 events and 1 state founded. 560 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
