<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/september-9">9 September</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Yelü Dashi's Qara Khitai rout the Seljuks at Qatwan</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">On the Qatwan steppe north of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samarkand">Samarkand</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qara-khitai">Qara Khitai</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yelu-dashi">Yelü Dashi</a> encircled and destroyed the army of the Seljuk sultan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ahmad-sanjar">Ahmad Sanjar</a>, who barely escaped. The defeat cost the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seljuk-empire">Seljuks</a> all of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/transoxiana">Transoxiana</a> and ended their authority in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-asia">Central Asia</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-qatwan">Battle of Qatwan</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yelu-dashi">Yelü Dashi</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qara-khitai">Qara Khitai</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/matilda-i-countess-of-boulogne" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/matilda-i-countess-of-boulogne.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/september-14">14 September</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Matilda of Boulogne's army routs Empress Matilda at Winchester</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The army of the imprisoned <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/stephen-king-of-england">King Stephen</a>, led by his queen, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/matilda-i-countess-of-boulogne">Matilda of Boulogne</a>, blockaded Empress Matilda's forces at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/winchester">Winchester</a> and crushed them as they retreated. Robert of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gloucester">Gloucester</a> was captured and exchanged for Stephen, who regained the throne.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/matilda-i-countess-of-boulogne">Matilda of Boulogne</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/stephen-king-of-england">Stephen</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/winchester">Winchester</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/the-anarchy" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/the-anarchy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/november-1">1 November</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">King Stephen releases Robert of Gloucester in a prisoner exchange</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">After the Rout of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/winchester">Winchester</a>, where Robert of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gloucester">Gloucester</a>, chief supporter of Empress Matilda, was captured, the two sides exchanged him for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/stephen-king-of-england">King Stephen</a>, whom Matilda's forces had held. Stephen released Robert, prolonging the civil war known as the Anarchy.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/the-anarchy">The Anarchy</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/stephen-king-of-england">Stephen, King of England</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lincoln-1141" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-lincoln-1141.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lincoln-1141">Battle of Lincoln (1141)</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Lincoln was fought on 2 February 1141 during the Anarchy, the English civil war between King Stephen and the Empress Matilda.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty · Peace</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-shaoxing">Treaty of Shaoxing</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Treaty of Shaoxing of 1141 ended the wars between the Southern Song dynasty and the Jurchen Jin dynasty.</p></div></li></ol></section>
